OL,3,ARussian bombing kills 31 people at
OL,4,AUkraine aid centre, Kyiv says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 31 people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter Russian bombs hit an aid
OL,8,Fdistribution centre in Zaporizhia, the
OL,9,FUkrainian regional head has said,
OL,10,Fdescribing it as one of the deadliest
OL,11,Fattacks there since the start of the
OL,12,Ffull-scale invasion.
OL,14,FMykhailo Semikin said at least nine
OL,15,F3,000kg aerial bombs hit the village of
OL,16,FKomyshuvakha in southern Ukraine on
OL,17,FMonday and the aid centre collapsed
OL,18,Ffrom a "direct hit".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
