OL,3,ARussian bombing kills 31 people at
OL,4,AUkraine aid centre, Kyiv says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They had come for help - not to a
OL,7,Fmilitary facility, not to a frontline
OL,8,Fposition, but to a place where they
OL,9,Fwere supposed to receive support," he
OL,10,Fwrote on Telegram.
OL,12,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,13,Fcalled the attack "utterly horrific"
OL,14,Fand said there were still people "under
OL,15,Fthe rubble".
